ent 18 → 40; all other modules unchanged and still green)."}]},{"id":"blk-33864","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49662","text":"1. The 12 ruled steps — where each landed"}]},{"id":"blk-33865","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49663","text":"Step 1 — shared "},{"id":"spn-49664","marks":["code"],"text":"ReceiptBuilderV1"}]},{"id":"blk-33866","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49665","text":"Receipt construction was pulled out of "},{"id":"spn-49666","marks":["code"],"text":"evalone.evaluate()"},{"id":"spn-49667","text":" into two functions in "},{"id":"spn-49668","marks":["code"],"text":"traaviis/evalone.py"},{"id":"spn-49669","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-33867","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33869","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49670","marks":["code"],"text":"_assemble_receipt(...)"},{"id":"spn-49671","text":" — assembles the 14-key receipt + sets "},{"id":"spn-49672","marks":["code"],"text":"episode_id"},{"id":"spn-49673","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-33868","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33871","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49674","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1(...)"},{"id":"spn-49675","text":" (exported) — computes "},{"id":"spn-49676","marks":["code"],"text":"score"},{"id":"spn-49677","text":", builds "},{"id":"spn-49678","marks":["code"],"text":"verification_evidence"}]}],"id":"blk-33870","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33872","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49679","text":"over the scored signals, derives "},{"id":"spn-49680","marks":["code"],"text":"outputs"},{"id":"spn-49681","text":", and calls "},{"id":"spn-49682","marks":["code"],"text":"_assemble_receipt"},{"id":"spn-49683","text":". Returns "},{"id":"spn-49684","marks":["code"],"text":"(receipt, verifier_evidence)"},{"id":"spn-49685","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33873","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49686","text":"Both the live "},{"id":"spn-49687","marks":["code"],"text":"evaluate()"},{"id":"spn-49688","text":" "},{"id":"spn-49689","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-49690","text":" "},{"id":"spn-49691","marks":["code"],"text":"verify_episode_bundle()"},{"id":"spn-49692","text":" now go through "},{"id":"spn-49693","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1"},{"id":"spn-49694","text":", so live and replay cannot structurally drift."}]},{"id":"blk-33874","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49695","text":"Step 2 — derive a fresh receipt on replay, require equality"}]},{"id":"blk-33875","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49696","marks":["code"],"text":"verify_episode_bundle"},{"id":"spn-49697","text":" rebuilds the receipt via "},{"id":"spn-49698","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1"},{"id":"spn-49699","text":" from the saved evidence and asserts "},{"id":"spn-49700","marks":["code"],"text":"canonicalize_episode(derived) == canonicalize_episode(stored)"},{"id":"spn-49701","text":" "},{"id":"spn-49702","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-49703","text":" "},{"id":"spn-49704","marks":["code"],"text":"episode_id(derived) == stored == identity.episode_id(receipt) == manifest.episode_id"},{"id":"spn-49705","text":". This single comparison subsumes reward + outputs + execution facts. New checks: "},{"id":"spn-49706","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"receipt\"]"},{"id":"spn-49707","text":" and the tightened "},{"id":"spn-49708","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"episode_id\"]"},{"id":"spn-49709","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49710","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-49711","marks":["code"],"text":"test_derived_receipt_equals_stored_receipt"},{"id":"spn-49712","text":" (positive) and "},{"id":"spn-49713","marks":["code"],"text":"test_stored_only_self_consistency_is_insufficient"},{"id":"spn-49714","text":" (a receipt re-sealed to be internally self-consistent after a lie still fails, because the evidence-derived receipt disagrees)."}]},{"id":"blk-33877","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49715",